      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "Depth Lens Blur — background blur from depth, after the shot.\n\nNo depth input is connected, so the node estimates depth itself with Depth Anything V2 Small (downloads ~100 MB to ComfyUI/models/depth_anything on first use). The Face Detect Lite face mask goes into focus_mask, so the focus plane is the face. max_blur sets the strongest blur in pixels; depth_of_field widens the sharp zone; bokeh = disc for a lens look, gaussian for a soft fade."
      ]
    }
